    "name": "Rapscallion",
    "instructions": "1. Combine the Scotch and sherry in a mixing glass and stir to chill and dilute.\n2. Pour the pastis into a chilled Nick & Nora glass, then dump the contents out to season it with the liqueur.\n3. Strain the cocktail into the pastis-rinsed glass, then express a lemon peel over the drink and garnish.",
